<span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">&mdash; the nearest one to San Gimignano, and the rules are not identical.</span></li><li><a href=/guides/italy-ztl-fines/ class="font-medium text-sky-800 dark:text-sky-300 underline">If a fine arrives after you get home</a>
